<view class="navbar" style="height: {{statusBarHeight + navBarHeight}}px;">
  <view style="height: {{statusBarHeight}}px;"></view>
  <view class="navbar-content" style="height: {{navBarHeight}}px;">
    <view class="navbar-back" bindtap="onBack">
      <svg-icon name="back" size="18px" />
    </view>
    <text class="navbar-title">第四步：设置提醒</text>
  </view>
</view>
<view style="height: {{statusBarHeight + navBarHeight}}px;"></view>

<view class="page-body">
  <image class="page-illustration" src="/images/icons/setup-illustration.svg" mode="aspectFit" />

  <text class="section-label">提醒方式</text>
  <view class="setting-card auth-card">
    <view class="setting-row auth-title-row">
      <view class="setting-row-left">
        <svg-icon name="wechat-large" size="26px" />
        <view class="setting-row-info">
          <text class="setting-row-label">微信通知提醒</text>
          <text class="setting-row-hint">用于接收放票提醒</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="checkbox {{channels.officialAccount ? 'checked' : ''}}">
        <svg-icon wx:if="{{channels.officialAccount}}" name="check-white" size="12px" />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="auth-divider"></view>

    <view class="auth-row">
      <text class="auth-label">微信通知权限：</text>
      <text class="auth-status {{systemOk ? 'ok' : 'off'}}">{{systemOk ? '已开启' : '未开启'}}</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{!systemOk}}" class="auth-inline-action" bindtap="onOpenSystem">去开启</view>

    <view class="auth-divider"></view>

    <view class="auth-row">
      <text class="auth-label">放票提醒授权：</text>
      <view class="quota-summary">
        <text wx:if="{{shortfall > 0}}" class="quota-short">还差 {{shortfall}} 次授权</text>
        <text wx:else class="quota-ok">授权次数已满足</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="quota-line">
      <text>本次 {{quotaNeeded}} 条提醒 · 已授权 {{subscribeQuota}} 次</text>
      <view wx:if="{{shortfall > 0 && systemOk}}" class="fill-quota-btn" bindtap="onFillQuota">点击补授权次数</view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{shortfall > 0 && systemOk}}" class="auth-note">
      <text>1、微信通知提醒需要主动授权，1次授权可发送1条提醒</text>
      <text>2、微信一次性订阅每次点击最多增加 1 次授权，需要几次请重复点击</text>
      <text>3、“总是保持以上选择”只会免去后续弹窗，不会让一次点击增加多次授权</text>
      <text>4、该能力当前限时免费，后续正式版可能付费。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="sample-link" bindtap="onOpenSample">
      <text>查看提醒样式示例</text>
      <svg-icon name="chevron-right" size="12px" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="setting-card sms-card">
    <view class="setting-row">
      <view class="setting-row-left">
        <svg-icon name="sms-bubble" size="24px" />
        <view class="setting-row-info">
          <text class="setting-row-label">短信提醒</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <text class="setting-row-coming">敬请期待</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <text class="section-label">提醒时间</text>
  <view class="setting-card">
    <view class="setting-row">
      <text class="setting-row-label">放票前</text>
      <view class="offset-options">
        <view class="offset-option" bindtap="onToggleOffset" data-val="5">
          <text>5分钟</text>
          <view class="checkbox {{checkedOffset5 ? 'checked' : ''}}">
            <svg-icon wx:if="{{checkedOffset5}}" name="check-white" size="12px" />
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="offset-option" bindtap="onToggleOffset" data-val="2">
          <text>2分钟</text>
          <view class="checkbox {{checkedOffset2 ? 'checked' : ''}}">
            <svg-icon wx:if="{{checkedOffset2}}" name="check-white" size="12px" />
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="submit-btn {{canSubmit ? '' : 'disabled'}}" bindtap="onSubmit">
    <svg-icon name="check" size="14px" />
    <text>开启行程放票提醒</text>
  </view>
  <text wx:if="{{gateText}}" class="gate-hint">{{gateText}}</text>
</view>

<reminder-sample-sheet show="{{showSampleSheet}}" bind:close="onCloseSample" />
